    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EGYPTAIR -\n720 FIFTH AVE. • NEW YORK, NY 10019-4168\nCABLE ADDRESS: EGYOAIR\nTELEX: 12-6358\nTELEPHONE: (212) 581-5600\n7 July 1983\nMr. Bill Hough\n244 Hamilton Avenue\nLos Altos, California 94022\nDear Mr. Hough:\nThank you for your request for information on Egypt and\nEgyptAir.\nAs requested, please find enclosed our latest tour brochures\nwhich I am sure you will find interesting and helpful in\nplanning your trip. These tours can be booked through your\nlocal travel agent. Also, reservations and ticketing can\nbe made through EgyptAir's office at the above address.\nWe appreciate your request and hope we will have the opport-\nunity to welcome you to Egypt via EgyptAir \"The National\nAirline of Egypt\"\nand to all our worldwide destinations.\nSincerely yours,\nPubeal is Queber\nRichard W. Proeber\nSales/Interline Manager, N.A.\nRWP/mb\nEnclosure:",
      "AIR\nEGYPTAIR\nM910019-\nThe International Airline of Egypt\nCOPENHAGEN\nBRUSSELS\nAMSTERDAM\nMUNICH\nFRANKFURT\nLONDON\nPARIS\n51 YEARS OF DEDICATED AIRLINE SERVICE\n(1932-1983)\nMIL\nTOKYO\nZURICH\nMADRID\nROME\nATHENS\nLARNACA\nGENEVA\nRHODES\n• BEIRUT\n• BAGHDAD\nAMMAN\n33\nKUWAIT\nTUNIS\nSHARJAH\n• JEDDAH\nSANAA\nALCICK\nKANO\nKHARTOUM\nACCRA\n• DHAHRAN\nDOHA\nBAHRAIN\nABU DHABI\nMUSCAT\nNAIROBI\nABIDJAN\nS MANILA\nDUBAI\nBANGKOK\nKARACHI\nBOMBAY\nPresently Serving\nFuture Service\nDAR ES SAALAM\n600\nPLEASE CALL EGYPTAIR FOR COMPLETE\nDETAILS, SCHEDULES AND INFORMATION\n700\nEGYPT\n73. 500\nMEDITERRANIAN SEA\nEgyptair\n720 Fifth Avenue\nNew York, N.Y. 10019\n(212) 581-5600\nPORT SAID\n67.700\nALEXANDRIA\nEL ALAMEIN\nISMAILIA\n28\n-000\nALSO:\nPHONE NUMBERS AND ADDRESSES FOR OUR\nEUROPEAN MAJOR OFFICES:\n.DOO\n7.09\nGIZA®\nHEMPHIS\n• SOKKARA\nLAKE KARUN\nFAYOUM OASIS •\nNILE RIVER\nCAIRO\nHELWAN\nI SUEZ\nST. CATHERINE\nMONASTER\nLONDON\n29-31 Piccadilly, W.I.\n(01) 7349490\nPARIS\n1, Bis Rue Aube\nParis 9eme\n266-5559\n884-5636\nROME\nVia Bissolati 76\n474-2641\nATHENS\n10, Othonos Street\n3233575/6/7\nCOPENHAGEN\n5, Jernbanegade\n128746\nFRANKFURT\nA.M. Hauptbahnhof 4\n353094/4\nGENEVA\n2, Rue de Berne\n31-38-36\nZURICH\nPelikanstrasse 37\n255592-3\nVIENNA\nOperninghof\nOpernring 1,\nGSA, Nabhan Tours\nA, 1010 Vienna\n222/574532\nNINIA •\nTEL ELAMARNA\nHURGHADA\nNILE RIVER\nRED SEA\nNEW VALLEY\n• ABYDOS\n• DENDERA\nTHEBES\nNECROPOLIS\nLUXOR\nKARNAK •\nESNA\n• KORN OMBA\nASWAN\nNEW HIGH DAM\nABU SIMBE\nOFFICIAL AIRLINE GUIDE - AIRLINE SERVICE INFORMATION SECTION\nPage T-47"
